data/archive/

# CATALAN local store (standalone study)
catalan/data/*.db
catalan/data/*.db-*
# NOT catalan/data/forward_log/ — that directory is the study's SYSTEM OF
# RECORD, not build output. It is committed on purpose: CI runners are
# ephemeral and Turso writes are quota-blocked, so if the archive is not in git
# it does not exist anywhere durable. The commit timestamps are also the
# tamper-evident proof that a headline was recorded before its outcome was
# known, which is what the pre-registration's contamination argument rests on.
# Ignoring it makes the daily Action's `git add` a no-op that still exits 0 —
# silent, permanent loss of one day per day. See catalan/CLAUDE.md.
catalan/**/__pycache__/
